== Trade-Offs
[.stretch]
[cols="1,1,1,1", options="header", width="100%"]
|===
| Approach | Strength | Weakness | Use
| Accept draft | Fast start | Hides risk | Exploration
| Guard transition | Protects invariant | More code | State changes
| Add idempotency | Tolerates retry | Needs keys | Side effects
| Pressure test | Reveals timing | Slower feedback | Design defense
|===

